acceptance_criteria:
- Sculptor model computed for all mid/large initiatives in Cycle 2026-W09; differences vs RICE documented and justified;
- At least one historical launch used to calibrate beta; calibration notes captured;
- Spreadsheet and Confluence template live in product docs; a pull request for a small scoring helper in ENG repo exists;
- Roadmapping session on 2026-03-05 uses Sculptor outputs, and PMs record explicit override decisions if any;
- Stakeholders (Eng, Design, Sales) sign off on rollout plan.
